SUMMARY:Mazzoleni Hall:  Kronos Quartet ($25)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nThe ***acclaimed Kronos Quartet*** joi
 ns quartets from The Glenn Gould School for an intimate concert\, featurin
 g selections from their groundbreaking *50 for the Future* project.\n\nhtt
 ps://kronosquartet.org/\n\nhttps://50ftf.kronosquartet.org/\n\n**PROGRAM**
 : To be announced closer to the concert.\n\nThis is part of Koerner Hall's
  ***21C Festival***--of new music!\n\n**Ticket link here:**\n\nhttps://www
 .rcmusic.com/concert/kronos-quartet-with-ggs-455001\n\nYou could use the P
 ROMO code **ISCULTURE15**\n\nFor 15% off ticket price (making your ticket 
 only $22)\n\nAny seat is a great seat!
